  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: I suppose that's something.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: You know how they work now, don't you?
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Keep listening.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Keep watching.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Don't waste that flashlight.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: And about that window...
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Leaving it open won't make anything go away.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: It just means you won't hear it coming next time.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Strange how comfortable you've gotten with things that hurt you.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Anyway.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
      day: 0
      night: 0
      requiredFlag: 
      flagValue: 1
      choiceSource: 
      choiceEntry: 
      choiceReply: 
    choices: []
  - speaker: TheTruth
    text: Try to get through another night.
    charactersPerSecond: -1
    eventId: 
    eventAfterLine: 1
    pauseForAnimation: 0
    hideDuringEvent: 0
    condition:
